"""Inline weights blob for the trained shot-validator MLP ensemble.

Pulled from sibling branch `claude/competition-objective-alignment-hqNVM`
at commit `4a8e4c0`. The blob is a gzip+base64-encoded numpy .npz file
containing:

  - threshold : float (the τ tuned for our-side rejection; not used by
                the opp-model variant, which reads `BASELINE_OPP_MLP_THRESHOLD`)
  - m{i}_{W0,b0,W1,b1,W2,b2} for i in 0..2 (3-MLP ensemble)
    layer shapes: (25, 64) -> (64, 32) -> (32, 1)

Lives in its own module so other consumers (e.g. an OPP-model tier) can
import the blob cleanly without grepping it out of an agent wrapper. The
bundler inlines this module once.
"""

